# Line endings
#
# Normalise every text file to LF, both in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Why: this repo carried a pocket of ~20 CRLF files left over from the original 2021 scaffold, while
# everything written since is LF. Editors faithfully preserve whatever a file already has, so the mix
# never healed on its own - and any tool that rewrites a whole file (a codemod, a script, a formatter)
# silently converted those files and produced diffs of hundreds of phantom lines.
#
# `text=auto` still lets git detect binary content on its own, so images, keystores and fonts are
# left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF - there are none here today, but this keeps that true if one
# ever arrives (the backend repo has mvnw.cmd for exactly this reason).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
